{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"alirezarezvani--claude-skills--deep-learning-book","name":"deep-learning-book","description":"Study companion and working knowledge base for the Deep Learning textbook by Goodfellow, Bengio & Courville (MIT Press, 2016), read free at deeplearningbook.org. Indexes all 20 chapters, carries a 2016-to-2026 delta layer naming what the book got right, what was superseded (transformers, AdamW, diffusion, double descent) and what still holds, and ships four deterministic tools: a prerequisite-aware reading-path planner, a training-failure diagnostic, a capacity-and-regularization planner, and a parameter/FLOP/activation-memory calculator. Use when studying or teaching this book, planning a route through it, deciding whether a chapter's advice is still current, or translating its math into a training decision. It points at the official chapters — it never reproduces them.","category":"Development","tags":["deep","learning","book","study","companion","working","knowledge","base","textbook","by","goodfellow","bengio","courville","mit","press","2016","read","free"],"repo":"alirezarezvani/claude-skills","owner":"alirezarezvani","stars":26382,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94","path":"engineering/deep-learning-book/skills/deep-learning-book","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/tree/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/engineering/deep-learning-book/skills/deep-learning-book","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-26T13:53:02Z","fileCount":36,"bytes":188361,"sha256":"d08dbf58db06299310321316fa40228e88adaf27356c1c38c5a79bfc3fca28b3","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"engineering/deep-learning-book/skills/deep-learning-book/SKILL.md","bytes":11601,"sha256":"d08dbf58db06299310321316fa40228e88adaf27356c1c38c5a79bfc3fca28b3","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alirezare